# Keep secrets, local environments and build output out of every image build context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.claude
.vs
.vscode
docs
OSRIP
# Database backups (accounts, password hashes, every record) and a checkout's own launcher
# settings never enter an image.
**/*.backup
**/*.backup.json
**/*.dump
**/*.pgdump
**/OSRIP-Backups
.osrip-local.json
